00:14:52.400 --> 00:14:56.240
But the truth is that we're not in a democracy.

00:14:56.240 --> 00:15:03.440
And even in a democracy, once the supreme authority, the supreme court, teaches something,

00:15:03.440 --> 00:15:05.440
