00:15:45.040 --> 00:15:53.440
have a right to appeal to your service. But I am talking to you as a human to a human.

00:15:53.440 --> 00:16:03.440
It's a private, it's a private plea.

00:16:03.440 --> 00:16:06.440
It's a personal plea.

00:16:06.440 --> 00:16:13.440
Now, you have right to be angry.

00:16:13.440 --> 00:16:15.440
Why?

00:16:15.440 --> 00:16:19.440
