One of them was taken away from him.

00:27:25.220 --> 00:27:27.360
I have two sons and a wife.

00:27:27.360 --> 00:27:33.300
he must have been devoured

00:27:33.300 --> 00:27:34.700
by an animal

00:27:34.700 --> 00:27:40.720
I never saw him again

00:27:40.720 --> 00:27:42.120
and

00:27:42.120 --> 00:27:47.620
if you shall take this child also

00:27:47.620 --> 00:27:50.420
and something shall happen to him

00:27:50.420 --> 00:27:54.560
because Jacob suspected

00:27:54.560 --> 00:27:56.600
in the heart of fire

00:27:56.600 --> 00:27:59.600
that what Joseph had told him once

00:27:59.600 --> 00:28:05.180
that his children were bad

00:28:05.180 --> 00:28:07.580
that his children were inhuman

00:28:07.580 --> 00:28:11.180
that his children may have killed him

00:28:11.180 --> 00:28:14.660
he suspected that this may have been true

00:28:14.660 --> 00:28:17.420
and therefore he was afraid

00:28:17.420 --> 00:28:20.740
Jacob, maybe the whole thing was

00:28:20.740 --> 00:28:23.600
a plot, another

00:28:23.600 --> 00:28:26.480
excuse to have Benjamin

00:28:26.480 --> 00:28:28.900
out

00:28:28.900 --> 00:28:30.900
so that all of a sudden

00:28:30.900 --> 00:28:32.480
a long journey

00:28:32.480 --> 00:28:35.160
and donkey from Israel

00:28:35.160 --> 00:28:36.340
to Egypt

00:28:36.340 --> 00:28:39.140
probably is one of the most

00:28:39.140 --> 00:28:41.440
arid and desolate deserts

00:28:41.440 --> 00:28:42.500
in this globe

00:28:42.500 --> 00:28:44.400
that

00:28:44.400 --> 00:28:46.980
could serve as a hundred

00:28:46.980 --> 00:28:49.380
opportunities to find an excuse

00:28:49.380 --> 00:28:50.700
why Benjamin

00:28:50.700 --> 00:28:51.940
died

00:28:51.940 --> 00:28:58.720
and my one hair

00:28:58.720 --> 00:29:01.000
will go down

00:29:01.000 --> 00:29:03.080
to the grave

00:29:03.080 --> 00:29:05.420
in evil

00:29:05.420 --> 00:29:06.220
in pain

00:29:06.220 --> 00:29:08.280
now

00:29:08.280 --> 00:29:11.760
Judah all of a sudden

00:29:11.760 --> 00:29:13.120
developed something

00:29:13.120 --> 00:29:14.320
that nobody had before

00:29:14.320 --> 00:29:17.060
you know it's called in English a conscience

00:29:17.060 --> 00:29:19.260
now Judah has a conscience

00:29:19.260 --> 00:29:26.800
how could I come back

00:29:26.800 --> 00:29:27.980
to my father

00:29:27.980 --> 00:29:33.060
without the child

00:29:33.060 --> 00:29:34.200
with us

00:29:34.200 --> 00:29:40.620
and the soul of my father

00:29:40.620 --> 00:29:42.600
is tied with the soul

00:29:42.600 --> 00:29:43.820
of Benjamin

00:29:43.820 --> 00:29:51.380
and when he will discover

00:29:51.380 --> 00:29:53.960
that Benjamin is not with him

00:29:53.960 --> 00:29:54.880
with us

00:29:54.880 --> 00:29:56.160
he shall die

00:29:56.160 --> 00:30:03.100
and now he says the most important line

00:30:03.100 --> 00:30:08.760
I am the guarantor

00:30:08.760 --> 00:30:12.700
of that boy

00:30:12.700 --> 00:30:17.140
because I told my father

00:30:17.140 --> 00:30:26.180
this is exactly what Joseph wants

00:30:26.180 --> 00:30:29.580
we Jewish people

00:30:29.580 --> 00:30:32.220
we the children of

00:30:32.220 --> 00:30:33.720
Jacob

00:30:33.720 --> 00:30:39.080
we must be a guarantor

00:30:39.080 --> 00:30:40.840
one to the other

00:30:40.840 --> 00:30:45.220
This is one of the most important concepts in Judaism.

00:30:45.220 --> 00:30:57.400
Ko Yisrael ha-revim zeh vaseh. We cannot teach each other. And now Judah, Judah, he is the

00:30:57.400 --> 00:31:04.480
guarantor of Benjamin. Now he's gonna beg. He's gonna beg. You know what he's gonna beg?

00:31:04.480 --> 00:31:09.520
What is the thing that Judah loved more? Gur al-Yehuda. What is a young

00:31:09.520 --> 00:31:23.520
lion loves freedom. Run through the jungle. Scare everybody. Alright? Enjoy movement. And now he is going to beg.

00:31:23.520 --> 00:31:29.520
To be exactly the opposite. Let me be a slave in place of Benjamin.

00:31:29.520 --> 00:31:40.120
Let me be a slave in place of this little boy.

00:31:43.960 --> 00:31:50.860
And the brother, let me just go back home with his brother.

00:31:53.800 --> 00:31:56.020
How am I going to go to see my father?

00:31:56.020 --> 00:32:00.620
and the child is not with me

00:32:00.620 --> 00:32:03.260
I don't want to see

00:32:03.260 --> 00:32:04.440
the evil

00:32:04.440 --> 00:32:06.220
the set face

00:32:06.220 --> 00:32:11.720
and that is the end of the speech

00:32:11.720 --> 00:32:13.340
alright

00:32:13.340 --> 00:32:14.720
now

00:32:14.720 --> 00:32:17.780
he spoke this

00:32:17.780 --> 00:32:19.780
in Joseph's palace

00:32:19.780 --> 00:32:22.180
as he was speaking

00:32:22.180 --> 00:32:24.260
all

00:32:24.260 --> 00:32:25.600
the officers

00:32:25.600 --> 00:32:29.000
every magistrate

00:32:29.000 --> 00:32:31.220
men of the army

00:32:31.220 --> 00:32:33.280
were witnessing

00:32:33.280 --> 00:32:35.960
because they knew that Joseph

00:32:35.960 --> 00:32:38.800
was a just man

00:32:38.800 --> 00:32:40.640
somehow

00:32:40.640 --> 00:32:43.800
this stranger

00:32:43.800 --> 00:32:47.100
was begging to become a slave

00:32:47.100 --> 00:32:49.080
mind you

00:32:49.080 --> 00:32:51.660
brotherhood, the whole family

00:32:51.660 --> 00:32:53.380
the whole idea

00:32:53.380 --> 00:32:55.100
about, um,

00:32:56.340 --> 00:32:58.040
we are responsible for each other,

00:32:58.780 --> 00:33:00.520
but we should speak to one another.

00:33:01.360 --> 00:33:02.560
That wasn't any concept.

00:33:03.120 --> 00:33:04.220
I don't know what I would have done.

00:33:04.820 --> 00:33:05.960
Once I saw,

00:33:06.200 --> 00:33:07.860
I used to love nature films.

00:33:08.220 --> 00:33:09.780
I used to love nature films.

00:33:10.620 --> 00:33:12.520
And once I saw

00:33:12.520 --> 00:33:14.320
something, I don't know what it was,

00:33:14.440 --> 00:33:15.840
buffaloes or something like this,

00:33:16.240 --> 00:33:17.400
by a river.

00:33:18.240 --> 00:33:20.000
And I remember that there was like a lion.

00:33:20.760 --> 00:33:21.940
The lion would come

00:33:21.940 --> 00:33:24.140
and see the buffaloes

00:33:24.140 --> 00:33:25.720
and attack the buffaloes

00:33:25.720 --> 00:33:27.120
and all the buffaloes run

00:33:27.120 --> 00:33:30.280
and the buffalo, the lion would catch one buffalo.

00:33:31.180 --> 00:33:31.820
And I always said,

00:33:31.980 --> 00:33:33.180
why the buffalo don't turn

00:33:33.180 --> 00:33:35.500
to the lion

00:33:35.500 --> 00:33:37.240
and start fighting together

00:33:37.240 --> 00:33:38.700
to protect each other?

00:33:40.080 --> 00:33:40.780
No one's a child.

00:33:42.120 --> 00:33:43.380
That's a good question.

00:33:44.220 --> 00:33:45.100
The answer is

00:33:45.100 --> 00:33:46.880
that the notion of

00:33:46.880 --> 00:33:48.160
solidarity,

00:33:49.240 --> 00:33:51.060
of mutual protection

00:33:51.060 --> 00:33:55.020
it's not common in the world of nature.

00:33:55.860 --> 00:33:58.660
And at one time it was not even common in the world of men.

00:33:59.880 --> 00:34:03.200
And these Egyptians, they were witnessing the birth

00:34:03.200 --> 00:34:05.880
of a new class of individuals.

00:34:07.420 --> 00:34:10.900
We, the Jewish people, are the Omega men.

00:34:11.620 --> 00:34:15.260
The Omega men and the Omega women. We are the men of the future.

00:34:16.920 --> 00:34:18.240
Because, I tell you why.

00:34:18.240 --> 00:34:21.000
because the feelings that we have today

00:34:21.000 --> 00:34:21.920
are values

00:34:21.920 --> 00:34:24.420
we are so out

00:34:24.420 --> 00:34:26.960
are the values that

00:34:26.960 --> 00:34:29.140
should serve as an example for the rest of

00:34:29.140 --> 00:34:29.580
mankind

00:34:29.580 --> 00:34:32.880
who taught mankind the notion of family

00:34:32.880 --> 00:34:35.120
you know

00:34:35.120 --> 00:34:36.320
I don't know

00:34:36.320 --> 00:34:39.380
the sanctity of the home, the sanctity of the wife

00:34:39.380 --> 00:34:40.720
the sanctity of the children

00:34:40.720 --> 00:34:43.080
our responsibility

00:34:43.080 --> 00:34:44.140
towards one another

00:34:44.140 --> 00:34:45.900
our responsibility towards

00:34:45.900 --> 00:34:47.760
our brethren

00:34:47.760 --> 00:34:49.760
What told you this to be a good time?

00:34:49.760 --> 00:34:51.760
Yeah, I want to tell this.

00:34:51.760 --> 00:34:53.760
You don't believe it?

00:34:53.760 --> 00:34:55.760
No, but I'm telling it.

