Have you ever heard one of these guys, what's his name?

00:35:07.760 --> 00:35:08.760
This guy from...

00:35:08.760 --> 00:35:09.760
Farrakhan.

00:35:09.760 --> 00:35:10.760
I forgot his name.

00:35:10.760 --> 00:35:11.760
Farrakhan.

00:35:11.760 --> 00:35:12.760
Farrakhan!

00:35:12.760 --> 00:35:16.760
All the brotherhood of Islam and so on, and how we take care of each other and so on.

