00:35:29.980 --> 00:35:39.080
What about Egypt and Sudan and Tripoli and Kuwait and Syria and other countries sending a little bit of food?

00:35:39.920 --> 00:35:40.680
Nothing.

00:35:41.120 --> 00:35:41.420
Nothing.

00:35:41.500 --> 00:35:42.120
Nothing at all.

