01:27:47.520 --> 01:27:48.260
It's this Thursday.

01:27:48.780 --> 01:27:52.380
Now, as I mentioned last week, everything is donated.

01:27:52.720 --> 01:27:58.020
The cakes, there will be a Chinese auction, a lot of merchandise has been donated.

01:27:58.200 --> 01:28:03.040
Also, there's going to be a health food section, which a lot of girls put a lot of work into.

01:28:03.420 --> 01:28:08.960
However, the costs we are trying to raise from the classmates in this lecture.

01:28:08.960 --> 01:28:13.760
So whoever did not put last week, we give you an opportunity to make this.

01:28:13.940 --> 01:28:15.120
You want to put again? Fine.

01:28:15.800 --> 01:28:18.220
We need the course, and please come.

01:28:19.920 --> 01:28:22.040
We hope to make it a big success.

01:28:22.700 --> 01:28:28.300
All the proceeds from this bake sale will go towards completion of this building,

01:28:28.720 --> 01:28:32.800
which with God's help and a little more cooperation, which we're starting to get,

01:28:33.080 --> 01:28:36.840
we will finish this building, finishing touches, within the next couple of months.

01:28:36.840 --> 01:28:39.080
right after New Year the building will be working again

01:28:39.080 --> 01:28:40.780
and there's a lot of

01:28:40.780 --> 01:28:42.960
things that have to be finished yet and we will

01:28:42.960 --> 01:28:44.860
finish them so thanks for your

01:28:44.860 --> 01:28:46.960
cooperation keep coming to lectures

01:28:46.960 --> 01:28:48.920
and come to prayers

01:28:48.920 --> 01:28:50.740
Saturday morning if you enjoyed the lecture

01:28:50.740 --> 01:28:52.540
tonight this is

01:28:52.540 --> 01:28:54.740
more or less what the sermons are

01:28:54.740 --> 01:28:57.280
the sermons are better

01:28:57.280 --> 01:28:58.940
take my word

01:28:58.940 --> 01:29:00.020
ok thank you

01:29:06.840 --> 01:29:10.120
This was good.

01:29:10.600 --> 01:29:12.320
Man, this was good.

01:29:12.740 --> 01:29:14.420
But I don't know now.

01:29:36.840 --> 01:30:06.820
Thank you.

